    "mq.cmFest": "Yi Peng of Lanna",
    "mq.cmFest.d": "Get through the Yi Peng-Loy Krathong festival once",
    "mq.cmFest.h": "The festival comes by itself every 30 days on the Chiang Mai map (days 24-26 of each cycle). More attractions mean more income. Let the game run past day 27 of the cycle",
    "v.road.oneway": "One-way street",
    "v.road.oneway.note": "Click a road tile to cycle direction (A → B → off) or drag along the direction you want. Vehicles cannot drive against it and traffic flows better (capacity ×1.3). Works on straight or curved tiles",
    "toast.ow": "A one-way street needs a road tile with exactly 2 connections (not a junction). Click an existing road",
