    "mq.parks30": "Lungs of the city",
    "mq.parks30.d": "Have 30 tiles of parks",
    "mq.parks30.h": "Pick the \"Park\" tool and place big ones, such as the 2×2 plaza, 2×2 sports field and 3×3 garden, for many tiles at once. Nearby homes grow faster and citizens are happier",
    "mq.daily": "Daily missions",
    "mq.dailyNote": "changes every day",
