    "mq.worship": "Place of worship",
    "mq.worship.d": "Have 1 place of worship",
    "mq.worship.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a temple, church or mosque (unlocks at level 2). Citizens will visit it",
    "mq.solar3": "Clean energy town",
    "mq.solar3.d": "Have 3 solar farms",
    "mq.solar3.h": "Pick the \"Power\" tool (key 6), hover and choose \"Solar farm\", and place 3. Cheap and pollution-free",
    "mq.bank": "Financial hub",
    "mq.bank.d": "Build 1 bank",
    "mq.bank.h": "Pick the \"Commercial\" tool (key 4), hover and choose \"Bank\", and place it next to a road. Unlocks at level 3 and raises finance tax",
    "mq.hospp": "Private hospital",
    "mq.hospp.d": "Build 1 private hospital",
    "mq.hospp.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a private hospital (2×2 tiles, unlocks at level 3). Treatment fees create tax",
    "mq.concert": "City of music",
    "mq.concert.d": "Build 1 concert hall",
    "mq.concert.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a concert hall (3×3 tiles, unlocks at level 3). Acts will come to perform at random; watch the city news to see who is coming",
    "mq.farms8": "Breadbasket",
    "mq.farms8.d": "Own 8 farms in total",
    "mq.farms8.h": "Pick the \"Farm\" tool (key 0) and place 8 farms of any kind, keeping water and power sufficient. Surplus can be exported once you have a freight terminal",
    "mq.freight": "Gateway to trade",
    "mq.freight.d": "Build 1 freight terminal",
    "mq.freight.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a freight terminal (3×2 tiles, unlocks at level 3). Goods then sell and buy at full price and you collect export tax",
    "mq.uni": "City of learning",
    "mq.uni.d": "Build 1 university",
    "mq.uni.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a university (3×3 tiles, unlocks at level 4). It trains skilled workers needed by high-end car factories",
    "mq.metro": "Metro arrives",
    "mq.metro.d": "Build 1 metro station",
    "mq.metro.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a metro station (2×1 tiles, unlocks at level 4) near housing. Its ~9 tile radius takes many cars off the road",
    "mq.concerts3": "Opening night",
    "mq.concerts3.d": "Hold 3 concerts",
    "mq.concerts3.h": "You need a concert hall or stadium. Concerts are scheduled at random (more likely at weekends). Watch the city news for announcements and let the game run",
    "mq.green50": "Planet-friendly",
    "mq.green50.d": "50% of power from clean sources",
    "mq.green50.h": "Build solar, wind, biomass or hydro until clean capacity is over half the city total (see the \"Utilities\" tab), and cut rooftop-solar tax in the policy panel",
    "mq.lv4": "Big city",
    "mq.lv4.d": "Grow the city to level 4",
    "mq.lv4.h": "Check the requirements on the level badge by the city name. Usually more population, high happiness, enough power/water, core services and public transit",
    "mq.pop3000": "Urban community",
    "mq.pop3000.d": "Reach a population of 3,000",
    "mq.pop3000.h": "Upgrade homes to condos and towers (double-click a house), add commercial/industrial zones for jobs, and keep power, water and traffic under control",
    "mq.stadium": "Sports arena",
    "mq.stadium.d": "Build 1 stadium",
    "mq.stadium.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a stadium (4×3 tiles, unlocks at level 4). It can host big concerts; superstars only perform when you have one",
    "mq.happy80": "Happy city",
    "mq.happy80.d": "80% citizen happiness",
    "mq.happy80.h": "See the \"Population\" tab and fix what is missing: parks, schools, hospitals, police, transit, shops, power/water, clean air, and tame the traffic",
    "mq.carcut40": "Jam-free city",
    "mq.carcut40.d": "Cut private cars on the road by 40%",
    "mq.carcut40.h": "Cover housing with metro, bus and taxi, raise parking fees and add park & ride next to metro stations. See the \"Transport\" tab",
    "mq.port": "Port city",
    "mq.port.d": "Build 1 seaport",
    "mq.port.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place a port (4×2 tiles, unlocks at level 4). It must touch a river or the sea, so pick a river or coastal map",
    "mq.rich200": "City tycoon",
    "mq.rich200.d": "Hold $200,000 in the treasury",
    "mq.rich200.h": "Save money by avoiding needless spending and raise daily net income (exports, banks, tourism tax, concerts). See the money card for income and expenses",
    "mq.pop5000": "Rising metropolis",
    "mq.pop5000.d": "Reach a population of 5,000",
    "mq.pop5000.h": "Build many towers and condos with jobs, services, mass transit and utilities that scale with the population",
    "mq.lv5": "Metropolis",
    "mq.lv5.d": "Grow the city to level 5",
    "mq.lv5.h": "Check the level badge. It needs a large population, high happiness, full services and transit, clean power and growing trade",
    "mq.airport": "Aviation hub",
    "mq.airport.d": "Build 1 airport",
    "mq.airport.h": "In the \"Service\" menu place an airport (5×3 tiles, unlocks at level 5, costs $9,500). It needs wide flat land beside a road and counts as 2 freight terminals",
    "mq.pop10000": "Capital of the future",
    "mq.pop10000.d": "Reach a population of 10,000",
    "mq.pop10000.h": "The ultimate goal: a city full of condos and skyscrapers, enough jobs, metro coverage, clean power, and an airport and port for trade",
