    "map.chiangmai": "Chiang Mai",
    "map.chiangmai.desc": "A plain basin ringed by high mountains: Doi Suthep to the west, the Ping river to the south and a square moat with four city gates in the centre",
    "v.service.concert": "Concert hall",
    "v.service.concert.note": "3×3 tiles, hosts random concerts; acts come to perform, crowds flock in and ticket sales earn money",
